{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GamePlugin"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/AddingCustomVerbs","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A plugin bundles the player-typeable vocabulary a system needs (","type":"text"},{"code":"buy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"attack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"ask","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") with the logic that reacts to it, so the system can be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shipped once and reused instead of hand-copied into every game.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct CommercePlugin: GamePlugin {","    static let buy = Intent(\"buy\")","","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] {","        SyntaxRule(\"buy\", .directObject, intent: Self.buy)","    }","}"]},{"text":"Logic-only: a plugin owns no state","anchor":"Logic-only-a-plugin-owns-no-state","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" bundle, a plugin’s stored children are not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"registered or namespaced by the bootstrap, so it declares no rooms, items,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" state of its own. It operates entirely over entities and globals","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"host","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" declares, receiving what it needs as parameters. That keeps a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plugin portable: it makes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assumptions about the host’s world beyond the traits and intents it agrees","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on. A plugin that genuinely needs to ship its own content is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" bundle instead (list it in the game’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The bootstrap enforces that boundary: a stored plugin containing a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Location","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Item","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Latch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is rejected before play.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"The host opts in by splicing","anchor":"The-host-opts-in-by-splicing","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The host stores the plugin as a plain property and splices its vocabulary,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default actions, and rules into its own blocks. ","type":"text"},{"code":"verbs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"actions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"merge just like a game’s own, and the plugin’s rule factories return","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" the host composes in. Together, ","type":"text"},{"code":"verbs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" + ","type":"text"},{"code":"actions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" let a plugin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ship a whole verb behavior — vocabulary and stage-4 default — without any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host rules at all; a host only needs its own rules to embellish or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"override that default for specific entities.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct LampShop: Game {","    let commerce = CommercePlugin()","    @Global var purse = Purse(coins: 10)","    let lantern = Item { name(\"brass lantern\"); trait(.price, 5) }","","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] { commerce.verbs }","    var rules: Rules {","        commerce.purchase(of: lantern,","                          balance: { purse.coins },","                          charge:  { purse.coins -= $0 })","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The protocol’s own ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/rules","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" requirement carries only self-contained,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"world-scoped rules that need nothing from the host. Rules that must reference","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host entities are exposed as ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"parameterized methods","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" returning ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"purchase(of:balance:charge:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" above), which the host calls with its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"declarations — every line still readable in the host’s source.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SplittingAGameAcrossFiles","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContentBundles","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContents","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScoreDeclaring"],"title":"Composing Large Games","anchor":"Composing-Large-Games"}],"metadata":{"title":"GamePlugin","symbolKind":"protocol","externalID":"s:6Gnusto10GamePluginP","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GamePlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Protocol","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GamePlugin"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A reusable game system — commerce, combat, dialog, magic — packaged as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"importable unit of ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"verbs","type":"text"}]},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"rules","type":"text"}]},{"text":", that a host game opts into.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/actions","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/command","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/gameText","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/docume