ults to empty. Precedence runs built-ins <","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bundles\/plugins < host game, so a host action for the same intent beats","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this one — and this is what lets a plugin’s verbs (like Phase 8’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"combat ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attack"},{"text":") actually do something by default, not just parse.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","defaultImplementations":1,"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/ScoreDeclaring":{"abstract":[{"text":"Content that can total the points it pays out, so the bootstrap can check a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Game\/maxScore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" against what the game is actually able to award.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/scoredeclaring","title":"ScoreDeclaring","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScoreDeclaring"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScoreDeclaring"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScoreDeclaring","role":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}